Subject: [PATCH] Switch registry-facade from hostPort to nodePort and remove
 hostPort from ws-daemon (#16518)

* Switch registry-facade and ws-daemon from hostPort to nodePort

* Update golden files

* Update ports

* Remove old setting

* Remove $WS_DAEMON_PORT

* Switch to podIP

* Tune GCE VM

* Use withObservability flag
